---@field anchor? posthog.persons.PathsV2Anchor|distilled.Null Anchor selecting anchored mode. When set, each actor contributes exactly one sequence bounded by the conversion window, so every displayed segment equals a plain funnel. Absent selects open mode, which splits an actor's events into journeys on the inactivity gap instead.
---@field applyTeamPathCleaning? boolean|distilled.Null Apply the team's path cleaning rules to naming property values before they become path items.
---@field collapseRepeats? boolean|distilled.Null Merge immediate repeats of the same path item within a journey.
---@field conversionWindowInterval? number|distilled.Null Anchored mode's single conversion window W, anchored at the anchor and reused verbatim as the emitted funnel's window. Bounds per unit are validated server-side against CONVERSION_WINDOW_INTERVAL_BOUNDS, the same funnel conversion window bounds as the gap.
---@field conversionWindowIntervalUnit? posthog.persons.FunnelConversionWindowTimeUnit|string|distilled.Null
---@field excludedItems? posthog.persons.PathsV2FilterExcludedItemsList|distilled.Null Path items dropped from the item universe: events deriving to one of these items are ignored as if their event were not a step source, on both the paths side and the "view as funnel" side.
---@field gapInterval? number|distilled.Null Inactivity gap that splits an actor's events into journeys. Bounds per unit are validated server-side against CONVERSION_WINDOW_INTERVAL_BOUNDS, the funnel conversion window bounds.
---@field gapIntervalUnit? posthog.persons.FunnelConversionWindowTimeUnit|string|distilled.Null
---@field localPathCleaningFilters? posthog.persons.PathsV2FilterLocalPathCleaningFiltersList|distilled.Null Path cleaning rules for this insight only, applied after the team's rules.
---@field maxRowsPerStep? number|distilled.Null Number of path item rows per step; items beyond this go into the "other" row.
---@field maxSteps? number|distilled.Null Number of journey steps (columns) shown.
---@field stepSources? posthog.persons.PathsV2FilterStepSourcesList|distilled.Null Step sources defining which events can become path items. Defaults to the pageviews preset: `$pageview` named by `$pathname`.

