---This endpoint allows you to bulk delete persons, either by the PostHog person IDs or by distinct IDs. You can pass in a maximum of 1000 IDs per call. Only events captured before the request will be deleted.
---
---Person records are removed in the background shortly after the request returns, so a successful response reports them in `persons_queued_for_deletion` and `persons_deleted` is 0.
---
---`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/persons/bulk_delete/`
---Errors: BadRequest, Forbidden, NotFound.
---@param input posthog.persons.PersonsBulkDeleteCreateRequest
---@return posthog.persons.PersonsBulkDeleteCreateResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:persons_bulk_delete_create(input) end

